- 谢谢，伙计。
我们快到了。

08:39.368 --> 08:42.092
Just a few more steps, and
we'll claim that free lunch.
只需再执行几步即可
我们会要求免费的午餐。

08:42.161 --> 08:44.541
- Yeah--
[hiccups]
- 是的--
[打嗝]

08:44.610 --> 08:47.230
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

08:47.299 --> 08:49.368
- Well, this is a dilly
of a pickle.
- 嗯，这是一个迪莉
一个泡菜。

08:49.437 --> 08:51.989
[laughing]
[笑]

08:52.058 --> 08:53.748
- Back it up!
- 支持一下！

08:53.816 --> 08:55.334
[screaming]
[尖叫]

08:55.403 --> 08:57.816
Back it up!
Back it up!
支持一下！
支持一下！

08:57.885 --> 09:00.541
[laughter]
[笑声]

09:00.610 --> 09:02.230
[screaming]
[尖叫]

09:02.299 --> 09:05.541
both: Oof.
Ta-da!
两人：噢。
哒哒！

09:05.610 --> 09:06.679
Oof.
钱币。

09:06.748 --> 09:09.575
- I hope you didn't damage
my goods.
- 我希望你没有损坏
我的货。

09:09.644 --> 09:11.575
- Oh, your goods are all good,
Bubble Bass.
-哦，你的货都很好，
泡泡贝斯.

09:11.644 --> 09:13.196
And we sure built up
an appetite
我们确实建立了
有食欲

09:13.265 --> 09:14.954
for that free lunch.
为了那份免费的午餐。

09:15.023 --> 09:16.506
[laughs]
[笑]

09:16.575 --> 09:18.437
- [gulps]
- [吞咽]

09:18.506 --> 09:19.885
[squeals]
[尖叫声]

09:19.954 --> 09:24.230
- Oh, yes, about that.
- 哦，是的，关于那个。

09:24.299 --> 09:27.541
I'm afraid I was waiting
for you so long
恐怕我一直在等待
为你这么久

09:27.610 --> 09:32.437
that I ate them.
我吃了它们。

09:32.506 --> 09:34.679
[chomping]
[咀嚼]

09:34.748 --> 09:36.541
Mmm.
嗯。

09:36.610 --> 09:38.816
[belches]
[打嗝]

09:38.885 --> 09:41.506
- [whimpers]
- [呜咽]

09:41.575 --> 09:42.954
- [inhales]
- [吸气]

09:43.023 --> 09:44.713
[grumbles]
[抱怨]

09:44.782 --> 09:49.437
If my friend SpongeBob
doesn't get his free lunch,
如果我的朋友海绵宝宝
没有得到免费的午餐，

09:49.506 --> 09:53.437
things are gonna get crazy!
事情会变得疯狂！

09:53.506 --> 09:55.851
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

09:55.920 --> 09:58.748
- That is the meanest thing
I ever saw, Bubble Bass.
- 这是最卑鄙的事
我见过，泡泡巴斯。

09:58.816 --> 10:02.885
You, sir, have crossed
the line of aquatic decency.
先生你已经穿越了
水生礼仪线。

10:02.954 --> 10:05.299
You may think you took
a couple of bottom feeders
你可能认为你拿了
几个底部喂食器

10:05.368 --> 10:07.644
for a ride today,
but I have got a newsflash
今天去兜风，
但我有一个新闻快报

10:07.713 --> 10:09.196
for you, slappy.
为了你，邋遢的。

10:09.265 --> 10:12.679
These bottom feeders
wouldn't eat your free lunch
这些底部喂食器
不会吃你的免费午餐

10:12.748 --> 10:15.196
if you paid us.
如果你付钱给我们。

10:15.265 --> 10:17.092
- I would.
- Come, Patrick.
- 我会的。
- 来吧，帕特里克。

10:17.161 --> 10:18.885
I'll make you
a free Krabby Patty
我会让你
免费蟹肉饼一份

10:18.954 --> 10:20.885
for $2.50 plus tax.
2.50 美元（含税）。

10:20.954 --> 10:22.713
- [laughs]
- [笑]

10:22.782 --> 10:26.127
Well, you pulled it off,
Bubble Bass.
好吧，你成功了，
泡泡贝斯.

10:26.196 --> 10:29.023
And you didn't even
have to flick a fin.
而你甚至没有
必须轻弹鳍。

10:29.092 --> 10:30.851
[humming]
[嗡嗡声]

10:30.920 --> 10:32.506
- [growls]
Bubble Bass,
- [咆哮]
泡泡鲈鱼，

10:32.575 --> 10:35.161
why do you think it's funny
to pack your mother in a box
你为什么觉得这很有趣
把你妈妈装进盒子里

10:35.230 --> 10:39.127
and drag her all over town?
- Mother?
然后拖着她满城跑？
- 母亲？

10:39.196 --> 10:42.989
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

10:43.058 --> 10:45.230
- We'll just see
how you like it.
- 我们会看看
你有多喜欢它。

10:45.299 --> 10:46.920
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

10:46.989 --> 10:48.954
- I didn't do it!
Ow!
- I didn't do it!
噢！

10:49.023 --> 10:50.610
Mother, please--
[grunts]
妈妈，请——
[咕哝]

10:50.679 --> 10:53.058
It was SpongeBob and Patrick!
[grunts]
这是海绵宝宝和帕特里克！
[咕哝]

10:53.127 --> 10:56.196
I'll dry the dishes, Mommy.
[grunts]
我会把碗擦干的，妈妈。
[咕哝]

10:56.265 --> 10:58.403
I love you, Mommy.
我爱你，妈妈。

11:00.679 --> 11:03.748
[light twangy music]
[轻快的鼻音音乐]

11:03.816 --> 11:10.885
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

♪ ♪